     "text": "{\"reachable\": false, \"rationale\": \"With h1_1:pivot and h2_1:pivot blocked, the target is not reachable. Each of crown:obtain's three parents fails. h3_0:escalate is an AND step that needs h1_1:pivot, so it is unreachable even though h1_0:reach is reachable. That removes h4_0:access and h5_1:access, which depend only on h3_0. h4_2:access needs h3_0 or h2_1, and both are unavailable. h3_1:escalate needs h1_1, so it is also unreachable. As a result, h5_0:reach, whose parents are h4_0, h4_2 and h3_1, is unreachable. h3_2:reach needs h2_1, so h5_2:pivot is unreachable. Since h5_0, h5_1 and h5_2 are all unreachable, crown:obtain cannot be reached.\"}"
